# HARD INVARIANT CHECKS
# ============================================================

Before accepting any derived cohort, automatically test these invariants.

### Drug/regimen invariants

- AB combination N cannot exceed atezolizumab union N or bevacizumab union N.
- STRIDE N cannot exceed durvalumab or tremelimumab union N.
- NI N cannot exceed nivolumab or ipilimumab union N.
- 2L patient N cannot exceed patients with a valid 1L.
